SF0187 Public employee retirement plan-contributions.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) Hicks
AN ACT relating to public employee retirement; increasing the employer and
employee contributions for the public employee retirement plan; specifying how
increased employee contributions shall be paid; providing appropriations; and
providing for an effective date.
